    "name": "Section 8.2(a) Cooperative Planning and Operation",
    "text": "8.2 Cooperative Planning and Operation. (a) The commission shall cooperate with the appropriate agencies of the signatory parties and with other public and private agencies in the planning and effectuation of a coordinated program of facilities and projects authorized by this article."
  },
  {
